              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "content": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Find the hypotenuse of a right-angled triangle with shorter sides $\\sqrt{5}$ cm and $\\sqrt{7}$ cm. Give your answer in surd form."
